    "welcomeTitle": "Welcome to DigitalMyHotels",
    "welcomeBody": "This short tour walks you through everything you need to run your hotel — from check-in to daily closing. You can replay it anytime from the help button in the header.",
    "sidebarTitle": "Your navigation",
    "sidebarBody": "Everything is organised by workflow: Overview, Front Desk, Property, Money and Operations. Items you see depend on your role — front-desk staff and housekeeping see only what they need.",
    "statusCardsTitle": "Live room status",
    "statusCardsBody": "A real-time snapshot of your property: total rooms, occupied, available, reserved, cleaning and maintenance. These update automatically as bookings, check-ins and housekeeping move rooms through their lifecycle.",
    "inhouseTitle": "In-house guests",
    "inhouseBody": "Guests currently staying with you, their rooms, expected check-out and payment status — so the front desk always knows who is in the building and who has dues.",
    "quickActionsTitle": "Quick actions",
    "quickActionsBody": "One-click shortcuts to the most frequent front-desk jobs: start a check-in, process a check-out, review room status or open billing history.",
    "checkinTitle": "Guest check-in",
    "checkinBody": "The full arrival workflow: find the booking, verify the guest with ID photos, add co-guests, capture emergency contact and vehicle details, pick chargeable services, and confirm — the room turns Occupied automatically.",
    "roomsTitle": "Room status",
    "roomsBody": "Manage room types, rooms and their live states. Rooms follow a strict lifecycle — Available → Reserved → Occupied → Cleaning → Available — so double booking is impossible.",
    "paymentsTitle": "Payments & ledger",
    "paymentsBody": "Collect Cash or UPI payments, add folio charges, and see the append-only guest ledger with a running balance. Refunds and corrections never overwrite history.",
    "expensesTitle": "Hotel expenses",
    "expensesBody": "Record expenses with categories and vendors. Each expense flows Draft → Submitted → Approved → Paid, and recurring templates create drafts automatically.",
    "reportsTitle": "Reports",
    "reportsBody": "Occupancy, revenue, payment methods, GST breakdowns per booking and expense summaries — with date filters and CSV export.",
    "bellTitle": "Notifications",
    "bellBody": "Alerts about your hotel show up here — renewals, approvals and operational events.",
    "localeTitle": "English / हिन्दी",
    "localeBody": "Switch the entire interface between English and Hindi at any time.",
    "planTitle": "Your subscription",
    "planBody": "View plans, check your expiry date and request a renewal here. If your plan ever expires, transactions pause until it is renewed.",
    "doneTitle": "You're all set!",
    "doneBody": "That's the essentials. Explore each section from the sidebar — and if you ever need this tour again, click the help icon in the header."
